# SBMI Weight-Based Navigation
Files weighted by line count → .L1.compact (lightest) → .L4.compact (heaviest)
## Weights
.L1 → 0-150 lines (quick ref)
.L2 → 151-300 lines (moderate detail)
.L3 → 301-500 lines (comprehensive)
.L4 → 501+ lines (deep dive)
## Strategy
Start light:
- Simple reference
- Quick command lookup
- Basic overview
Go heavier:
- Comprehensive understanding
- Architecture/design
- Debug/troubleshoot
- Complete implementation
You decide - lighter suffices or need full weight. Consider cost vs value.
## Examples
